/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:51859:	 (66723,23348,1,1,208,88,1,NULL,'隊列は薄く、陣形はその場しのぎで、武器は借り物だが、その行く手は塞がないのが一番だ。','Their ranks are thin, their formation is improvised, their weapons are borrowed, and you''d best get out of their way.','間に合わせの大隊と、他のクリーチャー２体以上が攻撃するたび、間に合わせの大隊の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。','Whenever Makeshift Battalion and at least two other creatures attack, put a +1/+1 counter on Makeshift Battalion.','3','2','22',0,false,0,'2019-04-19 03:35:02+09','2025-07-31 21:49:14+09'),
